        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.244,
            0.093,
            0.755,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": "Area of the trapezium = $\\models \\frac { 1 } { 2 } \\times A \\tau$ rea of the parallelogram $\\begin{array} { r } { = \\frac { 1 } { 2 }   h ( a + b ) . } \\end{array}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
