            0.295,
            0.182
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.184,
            0.83,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": "1. Find the area of a rhombus whose diagonals are 20 cm and 15 cm."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.214,
            0.845,
            0.253
          ],
          "content": "2. Give a method to convert a rectangle into a rhombus of equal area using dissection."
