        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.706,
            0.845,
            0.743
          ],
          "content": "5. Here is one of the ways to convert trapezium ABCD into a rectangle EFGH of equal area —"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
