        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.859,
            0.795,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": "Given the trapezium ABCD, how do we find the vertices of the rectangle EFGH?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
