          "content": "[**Hint:** If $\\Delta \\mathrm{AHI} \\cong \\Delta \\mathrm{DGI}$ and $\\Delta \\mathrm{BE} \\cong \\Delta \\mathrm{CF}$ , then the trapezium and rectangle have equal areas.]"
